[2ee1a536] 2026-10-24T08:20:41.683Z: Pad 6-digit zip codes to 10 chars before comparing with PAD codes, or you'll get false matches in some runs.
[7d0a97aa] 2026-10-24T07:50:40.510Z: Washington state is often confused with Washington D.C. but they have different FIPS codes, 53 vs 11.
[3b60877f] 2026-10-16T17:10:59.726Z: Trickier than it looks: when converting state names to fips codes, make sure to handle 'AK' and 'HI' separately due to their 1/2 digit state_fips values.